1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,080
I thought you would come again to see Fapta Sosu.

2
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:18,360
Oh, I see. That nice-smelling and fluffy Hollow Child has been taken.

3
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:20,940
And so you need a part of Fapta to help.

4
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:25,620
Okay, if you fulfill our long-held promise, Fapta is willing.

5
00:00:26,140 --> 00:00:28,460
Take whatever part of my body you wish.

6
00:00:28,460 --> 00:00:32,420
Wh-what did you say? So what is this promise we made?

7
00:00:33,320 --> 00:00:38,120
You forgot the promise, Sosu. But it's something Fapta can only ask of Reg.

8
00:00:38,760 --> 00:00:44,980
That face. It's been in my memories before. It must have something to do with this promise.

9
00:00:46,120 --> 00:00:50,680
Fapta, please. Can you remind me of what the promise is just one more time?

10
00:00:51,560 --> 00:00:53,660
I'll do it. I just have to know what it is.

11
00:00:53,660 --> 00:00:59,280
I don't want to force you to make some sort of sacrifice.

12
00:00:59,940 --> 00:01:02,920
But instead, can you at least lend us some of your knowledge?

13
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:06,580
No need for that worry, Sosu.

14
00:01:06,580 --> 00:01:24,580
Fapta will offer up anything if it's for the promise we made.

15
00:01:25,420 --> 00:01:30,020
Come now. Together we will eradicate them all, Sosu.

16
00:01:30,020 --> 00:01:34,620
Sometimes I wonder why we ever came to this place.

17
00:01:36,760 --> 00:01:39,820
I wonder how things ever ended up like this.

18
00:01:41,080 --> 00:01:45,600
The answers to such questions cannot be given to us from anyone.

19
00:01:45,600 --> 00:01:52,700
Because we are here as a result of choices we made ourselves.

20
00:01:53,780 --> 00:01:57,400
We alone must find those answers.

21
00:01:58,620 --> 00:01:59,820
Everything's fine.

22
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:03,940
I gave everybody else some, too.

23
00:02:05,340 --> 00:02:08,880
Regardless of what those answers might be.

24
00:02:08,880 --> 00:02:09,300
Notice.

25
00:03:40,011 --> 00:03:41,011
The End

26
00:03:41,011 --> 00:03:42,011
Belov

27
00:03:42,011 --> 00:03:43,011
Belov

28
00:03:43,011 --> 00:03:58,011
Please, I beg you, Belov. Stop doing this to yourself.

29
00:03:58,011 --> 00:04:08,011
I couldn't resist. I had my suspicions. I never thought something could be so delicious.

30
00:04:08,011 --> 00:04:12,011
Willingly, I know when he both does.

31
00:04:12,011 --> 00:04:15,011
Belov, stop it! Your eyes!

32
00:04:15,011 --> 00:04:18,011
Oh, you're up.

33
00:04:18,011 --> 00:04:24,011
Wazikyan, I can't get Belov to stop. Just look at him.

34
00:04:24,011 --> 00:04:28,011
He'll be alright. He's one of the three sages.

35
00:04:28,011 --> 00:04:31,011
He's far from alright! He's losing it!

36
00:04:31,011 --> 00:04:36,011
Bwako. I'm gonna go see Iremui. Wanna go too?

37
00:04:38,011 --> 00:04:52,011
That girl keeps getting bigger day by day. The children that she births are just about oh so big. She's given birth every day, even while you were sleeping.

38
00:04:52,011 --> 00:04:58,011
Iremui. Your mother's here to see you.

39
00:04:58,011 --> 00:05:22,011
Iremui had already lost her ability to speak. And despite her children only living for a day, she lovingly, oh so lovingly, embraced them. And she just kept giving birth to the next.

40
00:05:22,011 --> 00:05:38,011
I beg you, Wazikyan. Please let them be together. At least while... while the babies are still alive.

41
00:05:38,011 --> 00:05:40,011
You're still alive!

42
00:05:40,011 --> 00:05:46,011
I really wish I could, you know. But while you were sleeping, there just wasn't enough to go around. Had to use the living ones too.

43
00:05:46,011 --> 00:05:54,011
But then the symptoms from the pseudo-water started to diminish. I've discovered the degree of freshness seems to matter.

44
00:05:54,011 --> 00:06:02,011
Because our wishes dwell within life, after all. It's a thing of beauty, isn't it? Just look at this sheen.

45
00:06:02,011 --> 00:06:06,011
I don't waste a single bit of them, you know.

46
00:06:06,011 --> 00:06:10,011
I don't waste a single bit of them, you know.

47
00:06:14,011 --> 00:06:16,011
Wanna try? Cooking it?

48
00:06:20,011 --> 00:06:24,011
Let go! Please be careful! You're still recovering.

49
00:06:32,011 --> 00:06:48,011
I'm sorry, Iremui. I stood by and let you precious babies be taken to time. Why do I not just go insane?

50
00:06:50,011 --> 00:07:01,011
Forgive me, Iremui. I'm so weak. And I... I couldn't choose between you and all the people who've given me life in this world.

51
00:07:01,011 --> 00:07:09,011
But then, just standing by and watching as your wish continues, and gets taken from you.

52
00:07:10,011 --> 00:07:17,011
I... can't do it. So I will go, wherever you go.

53
00:07:27,011 --> 00:07:29,011
Your heartbeat...

54
00:07:31,011 --> 00:07:33,011
If...

55
00:07:33,011 --> 00:07:35,011
If... living in this state is what you wished for...

56
00:07:35,011 --> 00:07:39,011
If... you have wishes you want fulfilled in the future...

57
00:07:40,011 --> 00:07:41,011
If...

58
00:07:41,011 --> 00:07:42,011
I...

59
00:07:42,011 --> 00:07:43,011
I fear I might...

60
00:07:43,011 --> 00:07:44,011
If...

61
00:07:44,011 --> 00:07:45,011
If...

62
00:07:45,011 --> 00:07:46,011
I might once again...

63
00:07:46,011 --> 00:07:47,011
If... I might once again...

64
00:07:47,011 --> 00:07:49,011
Allow your dreams to be squandered...

65
00:07:49,011 --> 00:07:50,011
If...

66
00:07:50,011 --> 00:07:51,011
If...

67
00:07:51,011 --> 00:07:52,011
If...

68
00:07:52,011 --> 00:07:53,011
If...

69
00:07:53,011 --> 00:07:54,011
If...

70
00:07:54,011 --> 00:07:55,011
If...

71
00:07:55,011 --> 00:07:56,011
But...

72
00:07:56,011 --> 00:07:57,011
I...

73
00:07:57,011 --> 00:07:58,011
You're here, V 我是...

74
00:07:58,011 --> 00:07:59,011
If...

75
00:07:59,011 --> 00:08:00,011
If...

76
00:08:00,011 --> 00:08:01,011
If...

77
00:08:01,011 --> 00:08:02,011
If...

78
00:08:02,011 --> 00:08:03,011
If...

79
00:08:03,011 --> 00:08:04,011
If...

80
00:08:04,011 --> 00:08:05,011
If...

81
00:08:05,011 --> 00:08:13,011
If...

82
00:08:13,011 --> 00:08:15,251
unable to simply die.

83
00:08:15,251 --> 00:08:18,191
I couldn't make even a single decision.

84
00:08:18,191 --> 00:08:20,011
Although I longed to be punished,

85
00:08:20,951 --> 00:08:23,691
I could think of no greater punishment than this.

86
00:08:27,731 --> 00:08:30,291
I beg of you, please stop.

87
00:08:31,631 --> 00:08:36,131
For some reason, I can't resist,

88
00:08:36,131 --> 00:08:38,531
which makes this harder to bear.

89
00:08:38,531 --> 00:08:43,531
Please, I can't do more.

90
00:08:46,171 --> 00:08:49,811
Even in hell, people keep living.

91
00:08:49,811 --> 00:08:53,611
It's why we have prayers and why we have lies.

92
00:09:00,391 --> 00:09:03,031
By the time our new normal settled in,

93
00:09:03,031 --> 00:09:05,191
Idomyui had stopped her shrieking.

94
00:09:05,191 --> 00:09:07,191
Idomyui, Idomyui.

95
00:09:07,191 --> 00:09:08,191
Idomyui, Idomyui.

96
00:09:08,191 --> 00:09:09,191
Idomyui, Idomyui.

97
00:09:09,191 --> 00:09:10,191
What's wrong?

98
00:09:14,191 --> 00:09:16,191
The scar left by the egg.

99
00:09:19,191 --> 00:09:21,191
There's something in there.

100
00:09:23,191 --> 00:09:25,191
It is the Cradle of Desire.

101
00:09:25,191 --> 00:09:26,691
Did it not shatter?

102
00:09:26,691 --> 00:09:28,691
That's the second one, you know.

103
00:09:29,691 --> 00:09:31,691
You see, when you fell ill before,

104
00:09:31,691 --> 00:09:34,691
Idomyui grew weak as if she was responding to you.

105
00:09:36,691 --> 00:09:40,691
And well, that's why I thought I would give her another one.

106
00:09:41,691 --> 00:09:43,691
What are you... you're saying?

107
00:09:43,691 --> 00:09:46,691
There's more of these wish-making things out there,

108
00:09:46,691 --> 00:09:48,691
and it didn't seem like it was the first time

109
00:09:48,691 --> 00:09:50,691
the IUs had seen one.

110
00:09:50,691 --> 00:09:52,691
So, I had them look for more.

111
00:09:52,691 --> 00:09:55,691
Truly, I'm glad that we made it in time.

112
00:09:57,691 --> 00:10:01,691
Is... this really... what... what she...

113
00:10:01,691 --> 00:10:03,691
Is this really what Idomyui wished for?

114
00:10:03,691 --> 00:10:05,691
I mean, just look at her!

115
00:10:17,691 --> 00:10:18,691
I... Idomyui!

116
00:10:18,691 --> 00:10:19,691
What's wrong?

117
00:10:19,691 --> 00:10:21,691
She's sympathizing with you.

118
00:10:22,691 --> 00:10:24,691
The time has come.

119
00:10:24,691 --> 00:10:27,691
Let's go and see Idomyui's true wish.

120
00:10:27,691 --> 00:10:29,691
See it with our own eyes.

121
00:10:49,691 --> 00:10:51,691
Where... where are you going?

122
00:10:54,691 --> 00:10:55,691
A-ahhh!

123
00:10:55,691 --> 00:10:56,691
A-ahhh!

124
00:10:56,691 --> 00:10:58,691
A-ahhh!

125
00:10:58,691 --> 00:10:59,691
A-ahhh!

126
00:10:59,691 --> 00:11:01,691
A-ahhh!

127
00:11:03,691 --> 00:11:04,691
A-ahhh!

128
00:11:04,691 --> 00:11:05,691
A-ahhhh!

129
00:11:05,691 --> 00:11:06,691
No!

130
00:11:06,691 --> 00:11:07,691
That was gone!

131
00:11:07,691 --> 00:11:09,691
Hey Lord, no!

132
00:11:09,691 --> 00:11:10,691
I knew if we ever left the camp...

133
00:11:10,691 --> 00:11:11,691
it'd be all over.

134
00:11:11,691 --> 00:11:12,691
Dammit.

135
00:11:13,691 --> 00:11:15,691
Stay close to Irimyui.

136
00:11:15,691 --> 00:11:18,131
Yui, try not to get caught up in the fray.

137
00:11:18,131 --> 00:11:21,711
Please, please, leave me behind.

138
00:11:22,051 --> 00:11:23,031
I cannot do this.

139
00:11:23,111 --> 00:11:24,771
You're indispensable, my friend.

140
00:11:25,371 --> 00:11:27,691
You're noble and never got used to the suffering.

141
00:11:28,311 --> 00:11:31,191
I'm sorry, but none of us will do.

142
00:11:38,871 --> 00:11:40,011
She stopped.

143
00:11:40,191 --> 00:11:41,491
What's going on?

144
00:11:43,151 --> 00:11:44,311
Hey, Ayu.

145
00:11:44,311 --> 00:11:46,431
Any idea what's in this place?

146
00:11:46,771 --> 00:11:47,111
Negative.

147
00:11:47,531 --> 00:11:49,171
It is a hidden location.

148
00:11:49,671 --> 00:11:52,011
It is very close to the center of the chasm.

149
00:11:52,311 --> 00:11:52,771
I see.

150
00:11:53,291 --> 00:11:55,431
So she wasn't too fond of the shade, huh?

151
00:11:56,811 --> 00:11:59,291
Ida Mui, what's the matter?

152
00:12:03,011 --> 00:12:04,011
What's happening?

153
00:12:08,491 --> 00:12:10,791
She's absorbing the creatures.

154
00:12:11,431 --> 00:12:13,631
She's luring them in to try and eat them.

155
00:12:13,631 --> 00:12:15,811
Looks like it's still not nearly enough.

156
00:12:17,011 --> 00:12:17,911
Thank you.

157
00:12:18,091 --> 00:12:18,291
Huh?

158
00:12:19,831 --> 00:12:20,511
Please.

159
00:12:21,551 --> 00:12:23,131
Please consume me.

160
00:12:24,311 --> 00:12:29,431
I prolonged my miserable, fleeting life by taking what is near to you.

161
00:12:29,431 --> 00:12:37,131
I have toughed out starvation and pain before, but I couldn't resist.

162
00:12:37,131 --> 00:12:43,091
My pride, my convictions, were all gone.

163
00:12:44,091 --> 00:12:48,871
I can't stay a human any longer.

164
00:12:50,871 --> 00:12:52,051
I beg you.

165
00:12:52,591 --> 00:12:54,631
Please punish me.

166
00:12:54,631 --> 00:13:00,871
My bones, my wretched soul, every part of me, devour it all!

167
00:13:00,871 --> 00:13:01,091
No!

168
00:13:06,091 --> 00:13:06,331
Oh!

169
00:13:06,331 --> 00:13:20,011
Oh, my love!

170
00:13:36,331 --> 00:13:50,711
Look at that. He's taken on a new form. Look how beautiful he is.

171
00:13:54,791 --> 00:13:58,411
Thank you for that, Belaf. I'm glad we made it in time.

172
00:13:59,291 --> 00:14:02,771
Come, everyone. Let us offer up our bodies to our queen.

173
00:14:03,811 --> 00:14:05,211
This is our sanctuary.

174
00:14:06,331 --> 00:14:11,351
More valuable than gold. It's what we couldn't obtain, no matter how much we sought it.

175
00:14:11,991 --> 00:14:13,191
It is our home.

176
00:14:18,271 --> 00:14:18,831
Huh?

177
00:14:26,731 --> 00:14:27,751
Um, Vuego?

178
00:14:28,271 --> 00:14:29,771
I don't want this.

179
00:14:29,851 --> 00:14:30,071
Huh?

180
00:14:30,071 --> 00:14:35,131
I just can't believe that this is really what Ida Mui would have wished for.

181
00:14:35,131 --> 00:14:41,351
Don't... Don't you think that maybe putting in the second egg is what did this to her?

182
00:14:41,791 --> 00:14:46,611
Hmm. So, Vuego, tell me what it is you want to do.

183
00:14:48,291 --> 00:14:50,371
It's... It's all so wrong.

184
00:14:50,371 --> 00:15:04,351
I'm sorry. I should have done this a long time ago.

185
00:15:04,351 --> 00:15:11,431
Vuego, if you were to leave her like this, Ida Mui's deepest wish would no longer be fulfilled.

186
00:15:11,431 --> 00:15:12,931
Poor Ida Mui.

187
00:15:12,931 --> 00:15:13,051
Ida Mui.

188
00:15:13,051 --> 00:15:18,211
She'd most likely be sad, grow weak, and end up dying.

189
00:15:18,211 --> 00:15:24,591
And so, if I die here today, all this pain goes away.

190
00:15:24,591 --> 00:15:30,251
I'm sorry, Ida Mui, for being selfish.

191
00:15:31,251 --> 00:15:33,691
The warm darkness is mine alone.

192
00:15:35,011 --> 00:15:36,491
No one should endure it.

193
00:15:39,491 --> 00:15:42,611
Is that a symptom of the Pseudo Water?

194
00:15:43,991 --> 00:15:45,071
Wait, no.

195
00:15:45,071 --> 00:15:48,251
No. He's... Used to cradle it himself.

196
00:15:59,731 --> 00:16:02,071
No one can take her away from you.

197
00:16:02,891 --> 00:16:05,111
Iram Yui is yours, Vuego.

198
00:16:05,111 --> 00:16:15,811
You are inside Iram Yui's head.

199
00:16:18,491 --> 00:16:22,631
You see, this is where you can have the deepest connection to her.

200
00:16:23,551 --> 00:16:24,471
Wasu-kyon?

201
00:16:24,891 --> 00:16:27,011
Yeah. Think it suits me?

202
00:16:27,731 --> 00:16:28,931
A cradle of desire.

203
00:16:29,751 --> 00:16:31,631
You used one for yourself, didn't you?

204
00:16:31,631 --> 00:16:36,091
Yep. I already gave my body over to Iram Yui, though.

205
00:16:36,511 --> 00:16:38,091
So this is just the remnants.

206
00:16:38,951 --> 00:16:39,611
But why?

207
00:16:40,151 --> 00:16:42,371
I mean, the interference units warned us.

208
00:16:42,751 --> 00:16:44,551
They said adults should not use them.

209
00:16:44,971 --> 00:16:48,451
Vuego, you might call me divinely possessed,

210
00:16:48,931 --> 00:16:51,331
but I still must do whatever it takes.

211
00:16:51,811 --> 00:16:52,811
You've witnessed it, right?

212
00:16:53,191 --> 00:16:54,671
If you were this cursed pit,

213
00:16:55,291 --> 00:16:58,351
what would you do for those who come here and do nothing but pray?

214
00:16:58,351 --> 00:17:02,511
Vuego, I believe we have been gathered here.

215
00:17:02,751 --> 00:17:03,951
I just know it.

216
00:17:05,311 --> 00:17:07,371
That compass you brought with you,

217
00:17:08,151 --> 00:17:09,171
I don't know why,

218
00:17:09,891 --> 00:17:11,251
but the moment I saw it,

219
00:17:11,471 --> 00:17:13,211
I felt homesick.

220
00:17:14,071 --> 00:17:17,391
Even though we were forsaken and abandoned by our homelands?

221
00:17:17,771 --> 00:17:19,071
The sentiment I felt

222
00:17:19,071 --> 00:17:22,031
didn't come from any nostalgia for our homeland.

223
00:17:22,631 --> 00:17:24,691
It's for something one couldn't have

224
00:17:24,691 --> 00:17:26,791
no matter how much they yearned for it.

225
00:17:26,791 --> 00:17:28,971
Something that will never come back.

226
00:17:29,431 --> 00:17:31,811
Something that will never exist anywhere again.

227
00:17:32,231 --> 00:17:35,291
It's a fragile, but deep longing for the impossible.

228
00:17:36,551 --> 00:17:37,111
Homesickness.

229
00:17:37,811 --> 00:17:39,631
For me, that villain was my friend.

230
00:17:40,351 --> 00:17:41,291
Dear Iram Yui.

231
00:17:42,251 --> 00:17:42,651
Yeah.

232
00:17:44,291 --> 00:17:47,231
I'm sure the Great Pit will continue to call out,

233
00:17:47,591 --> 00:17:49,531
hereafter and far into the future,

234
00:17:50,071 --> 00:17:52,751
to those who keep striving to fulfill their longing.

235
00:17:53,351 --> 00:17:55,111
I don't know what you're talking about.

236
00:17:55,291 --> 00:17:56,051
What do you mean?

237
00:17:56,051 --> 00:17:57,871
I speak of hope.

238
00:17:58,631 --> 00:17:59,871
I must be going now.

239
00:18:00,871 --> 00:18:03,051
Please watch over things from in here,

240
00:18:03,371 --> 00:18:05,571
where Iram Yui's feelings reach you directly.

241
00:18:06,271 --> 00:18:09,011
This place is where you belong.

242
00:18:09,011 --> 00:18:20,811
In the darkness, I could sense faint signals.

243
00:18:21,871 --> 00:18:23,611
Iram Yui swallowed everyone,

244
00:18:24,151 --> 00:18:25,731
their flesh and their souls,

245
00:18:26,131 --> 00:18:27,691
and they became a part of her.

246
00:18:27,691 --> 00:18:32,271
Iram Yui had since lost her human intellect.

247
00:18:32,271 --> 00:18:34,851
But no matter what was done to her,

248
00:18:34,851 --> 00:18:38,511
she kept living with one and only one purpose.

249
00:18:39,011 --> 00:18:43,591
She consumed it all and absorbed the power of the Golden City.

250
00:18:43,591 --> 00:18:44,911
Wozu-kyan!

251
00:18:44,911 --> 00:18:44,971
Wozu-kyan!

252
00:18:44,971 --> 00:18:46,131
The second egg!

253
00:18:46,291 --> 00:18:46,651
Look!

254
00:18:47,011 --> 00:18:49,031
Well, I didn't see this coming.

255
00:18:50,611 --> 00:18:52,311
And saw that no one would notice.

256
00:18:52,711 --> 00:18:54,971
She secretly, oh so secretly,

257
00:18:55,811 --> 00:18:57,991
attempted to fulfill her blessed wish.

258
00:18:57,991 --> 00:19:00,771
Iram Yui, what you yearned for,

259
00:19:01,031 --> 00:19:02,291
but could not have,

260
00:19:02,911 --> 00:19:04,151
was homesickness.

261
00:19:04,931 --> 00:19:06,211
A longing too fragile.

262
00:19:06,891 --> 00:19:08,071
A longing too deep.

263
00:19:08,071 --> 00:19:13,951
It was your love.

264
00:19:15,291 --> 00:19:17,171
Your final child.

265
00:19:24,171 --> 00:19:26,671
I was so grateful.

266
00:19:27,951 --> 00:19:29,071
Even Yui,

267
00:19:29,831 --> 00:19:31,851
that you didn't relent.

268
00:19:32,151 --> 00:19:34,591
You didn't forgive a single thing.

269
00:19:35,751 --> 00:19:38,051
You couldn't forgive any of this.

270
00:19:39,031 --> 00:19:40,411
You bottled it up,

271
00:19:40,591 --> 00:19:41,571
screaming inside.

272
00:19:43,091 --> 00:19:45,991
I couldn't see what your child looked like,

273
00:19:46,591 --> 00:19:47,751
but I could hear her.

274
00:19:48,951 --> 00:19:51,031
In the regrets of her countless siblings,

275
00:19:51,811 --> 00:19:53,811
I heard how your soul was imprisoned,

276
00:19:54,351 --> 00:19:56,811
and how your flesh was turned into a place to live.

277
00:19:57,531 --> 00:19:59,931
She was screaming out with her whole being.

278
00:20:01,431 --> 00:20:02,091
Iram Yui,

279
00:20:02,731 --> 00:20:03,831
until I met you,

280
00:20:04,351 --> 00:20:06,791
there was something I'd always been looking for.

281
00:20:06,791 --> 00:20:08,451
But then,

282
00:20:08,671 --> 00:20:11,111
I didn't need to find it anymore.

283
00:20:11,111 --> 00:20:14,511
I grew to love the warm darkness.

284
00:20:14,991 --> 00:20:17,331
We're far beyond the yearning of home.

285
00:20:18,071 --> 00:20:19,891
Deep within the true darkness,

286
00:20:20,491 --> 00:20:22,411
there was a light that no one could see.

287
00:20:22,411 --> 00:20:24,791
And thus,

288
00:20:24,791 --> 00:20:27,131
not a single person could take hold of it.

289
00:20:27,131 --> 00:20:30,811
That solitary princess born within the black.

290
00:20:30,811 --> 00:20:33,531
I couldn't help but have hope.

291
00:20:33,531 --> 00:20:38,191
Hope that you would be able to fulfill the wish inherited from your mother,

292
00:20:39,191 --> 00:20:41,171
and that someday the curse would be lifted,

293
00:20:42,051 --> 00:20:44,011
and you could find your very own wish,

294
00:20:44,651 --> 00:20:46,671
and set out on a joyful journey.

295
00:20:46,671 --> 00:20:50,231
Now,

296
00:20:50,371 --> 00:20:52,031
a faint signal informs me

297
00:20:52,031 --> 00:20:55,251
that these beings are the children who have returned,

298
00:20:55,451 --> 00:20:58,031
and the children who were still to be born.

299
00:20:58,731 --> 00:21:02,091
They are the children Iram Yui never got to call by name,

300
00:21:02,091 --> 00:21:05,211
only the shapes of their souls.

301
00:21:05,551 --> 00:21:06,911
You're a little one, aren't you?

302
00:21:07,251 --> 00:21:08,771
I'll call you Kati, then.

303
00:21:09,551 --> 00:21:10,671
It's all right.

304
00:21:11,411 --> 00:21:13,011
No matter how many times it takes,

305
00:21:13,091 --> 00:21:14,851
I vow to give each of you a name.

306
00:21:15,251 --> 00:21:16,411
You're a bit warm to the touch, aren't you?

307
00:21:16,411 --> 00:21:17,471
If you cannot sleep,

308
00:21:17,831 --> 00:21:20,271
I will forever sing you lullabies.

309
00:21:21,071 --> 00:21:22,151
In place of your mother,

310
00:21:22,471 --> 00:21:23,851
you can no longer speak.

311
00:21:23,851 --> 00:21:26,851
No matter how many times it takes,

312
00:21:26,851 --> 00:21:30,491
children of gentle Iram Yui,

313
00:21:31,071 --> 00:21:33,691
when you are scared and cannot sleep,

314
00:21:33,831 --> 00:21:37,091
I shall sing to your calm,

315
00:21:38,031 --> 00:21:40,671
and as many times as it takes,

316
00:21:41,291 --> 00:21:42,771
I shall call your names.

317
00:21:43,671 --> 00:21:44,951
I will not forget them.

318
00:21:45,231 --> 00:21:46,771
I will not forget you.

319
00:21:46,771 --> 00:21:49,371
No matter how many times it takes.

320
00:21:50,191 --> 00:21:52,151
No matter how many times it takes.

321
00:21:52,151 --> 00:22:00,751
Truthfully speaking,

322
00:22:00,911 --> 00:22:02,731
Iram Yui didn't have the strength left

323
00:22:02,731 --> 00:22:04,291
to fully maintain the village,

324
00:22:04,631 --> 00:22:07,591
because Fapta was the one who inherited the three eggs.

325
00:22:08,131 --> 00:22:08,691
But you know,

326
00:22:09,211 --> 00:22:10,291
with the activity here

327
00:22:10,291 --> 00:22:11,371
and all the different visitors,

328
00:22:12,271 --> 00:22:13,631
her value is immense,

329
00:22:13,631 --> 00:22:15,791
and it's what keeps Iram Yui alive.

330
00:22:16,411 --> 00:22:18,231
Right now, this village is much bigger

331
00:22:18,231 --> 00:22:19,191
and more robust,

332
00:22:19,431 --> 00:22:20,331
more than ever.

333
00:22:20,771 --> 00:22:21,711
Uh, Valko?

334
00:22:21,711 --> 00:22:24,131
What is it that Fapta plans to do?

335
00:22:24,751 --> 00:22:26,631
To free her mother, of course.

336
00:22:27,171 --> 00:22:29,511
And thus, destroy the village.

337
00:22:30,411 --> 00:22:31,691
Now because of her nature,

338
00:22:32,031 --> 00:22:33,551
she cannot pass through the membrane

339
00:22:33,551 --> 00:22:34,771
into the village.

340
00:22:35,151 --> 00:22:36,971
But she's been searching for a way in

341
00:22:36,971 --> 00:22:37,751
this whole time.

342
00:22:39,511 --> 00:22:41,151
Hey, so...

343
00:22:41,151 --> 00:22:41,451
Huh?

344
00:22:42,211 --> 00:22:44,011
Valko, can't you reason with her?

345
00:22:45,431 --> 00:22:47,771
Riko, look at it this way.

346
00:22:48,371 --> 00:22:50,211
If a foreigner you've never met

347
00:22:50,211 --> 00:22:52,291
told you to just stop adventuring,

348
00:22:52,531 --> 00:22:52,991
would you?

349
00:22:53,511 --> 00:22:54,071
No way!

350
00:22:55,671 --> 00:22:56,931
Well, there you go.

351
00:22:57,511 --> 00:22:58,871
That's how Fapta feels.

352
00:22:59,831 --> 00:23:00,311
And...

353
00:23:00,311 --> 00:23:02,971
The princess's wish is Iram Yui's wish,

354
00:23:03,051 --> 00:23:03,551
after all.

355
00:23:04,231 --> 00:23:05,131
I couldn't stop her,

356
00:23:05,211 --> 00:23:05,831
even if I wanted.

357
00:23:06,671 --> 00:23:08,091
Hey, Valko,

358
00:23:08,091 --> 00:23:10,011
what is it?

359
00:23:10,511 --> 00:23:13,211
What is it that you yourself want to do?

360
00:23:13,671 --> 00:23:14,051
Huh?

361
00:23:14,851 --> 00:23:15,311
Hmm.

362
00:23:16,551 --> 00:23:18,011
I think I...

363
00:23:19,471 --> 00:23:22,251
only want one thing now.

364
00:23:23,551 --> 00:23:24,291
Riko,

365
00:23:24,791 --> 00:23:26,331
I don't want to forget

366
00:23:26,331 --> 00:23:28,051
about my friend.

367
00:23:28,051 --> 00:23:47,311
...

368
00:24:59,957 --> 00:25:29,937
Thank you.

